Description: Serve .opus, .mka, .m4b, .png and .webp; configurable extensions
 The video, audio and image extension lists behind is_video(), is_audio()
 and is_image() can now be replaced with video_extensions=,
 audio_extensions= and image_extensions= ('/' or ',' separated,
 case-insensitive; an empty value keeps the built-in list). The audio list
 gains .opus, .mka and .m4b, the image list .png and .webp.
 .
 Audio files without a built-in tag reader (.opus, .mka, or anything added
 to audio_extensions) are read with libavformat: duration, bitrate, sample
 rate, channels, tags and an attached cover. .m4b uses the MP4 reader.
 Non-JPEG pictures get their size from libavformat, PNG the PNG_LRG
 profile, and they are served as they are: resized versions and EXIF
 thumbnails are only advertised for JPEG.
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-21
